    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2fa25c62-ae01-51f0-bc38-6657aa88b875" activityNameId="895af715-a87f-54d7-987a-791e178db493" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Connector, computer, peripherical type, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Connector, computer, peripherical type, at plant
The data represent a current computer peripherical type connector, as used in current computers. Material data are taken from product sheets of producers. The energy demand is estimated based on literature. Infrastructure and transport efforts rough estimations. The dataset represents 1 kg of computer peripherical type connectors with a weight of 10 gram/unit. In 2023 updates, only production efforts are modified to reflect improved energy efficiency in the manufacturing; UUID: a2425cb3-89fe-32ba-abe6-2e1a5b51e72c
This dataset covers raw material input, energy consumption, infrastructure and transport efforts for the production of computer peripherical type connectors.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of a serial computer port.
Technology: average connector production technology, based on literature and assumptions
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a2425cb3-89fe-32ba-abe6-2e1a5b51e72c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
